        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(feishu): lock timeoutMs preflight abort for stalled DNS lookup",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFeishu app registration can hang when SSRF DNS/proxy preflight never completes. Without an entry-point regression on `beginAppRegistration`, a future change can stop forwarding `timeoutMs` into `fetchWithSsrFGuard` and leave onboarding stuck before HTTP dispatch.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nCurrent `main` (after [#105549](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/105549)) owns registration deadlines via **guard top-level `timeoutMs`**, not `AbortSignal.timeout()` in `RequestInit`. `beginAppRegistration(domain, options?)` still accepts test-only `fetchImpl` / `lookupFn` / `timeoutMs`.\n\nThis PR is test-only: it locks that contract for a never-resolving `lookupFn`, asserting `TimeoutError` + `message: \"request timed out\"` and that `fetchImpl` is never called. Shared SSRF suite already covers stalled DNS at the guard; this covers the Feishu registration wiring into that owner.\n\nRebuilt onto latest `main` `c69a75f697876c6e0b75996f10306b3ca6467203`.\n\nAI-assisted: yes. I inspected current `fetchFeishuJson` / `beginAppRegistration`, #105549, sibling hang-without-headers coverage, and `fetch-guard.ssrf` stalled-DNS tests before updating.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo runtime change. CI keeps a focused lock that stalled Feishu registration preflight fails closed with the guard-owned diagnostic and without opening an HTTP request.\n\n## Evidence\n\n**Contract on current main** (`extensions/feishu/src/app-registration.ts`): `fetchWithSsrFGuard({ ..., timeoutMs })` — see #105549 (“a second AbortSignal.timeout path was redundant”).\n\n**Focused suite:** `pnpm exec vitest run extensions/feishu/src/app-registration.test.ts` → **11 passed**\n\n**Refreshed entry-point proof** (production `beginAppRegistration`, no Vitest):\n\n```text\n[fetch-timeout] fetch timeout after 80ms (elapsed 81ms) operation=fetchWithSsrFGuard url=https://accounts.feishu.cn/oauth/v1/app/registration\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"phase\": \"beginAppRegistration-stalled-lookup\",\n  \"mainContract\": \"timeoutMs → fetchWithSsrFGuard (#105549)\",\n  \"timed_out\": true,\n  \"name\": \"TimeoutError\",\n  \"message\": \"request timed out\",\n  \"elapsed_ms\": 192\n}\n```\n\n```text\n[feishu preflight stall proof] timed_out=true name=TimeoutError message=request timed out elapsed_ms=81 fetch_called=0\n```\n\nHead: `5d7b34b6c956c5edc90da62d2dec4cedffddab49` (1 file / +35 vs `main` `c69a75f…`)\n",
